{"id": "xinjing_fayue", "type": "Text", "title": "普遍智藏般若波罗蜜多心经", "title_zh": "普遍智藏般若波罗蜜多心经", "translator": "法月", "category": "般若部类", "volume": "", "juan_count": 1, "actual_char_count": 387, "canon_ref": "T.252", "taisho": "T0252", "vehicle": "大乘", "mode": "显教", "translation_place": "西京", "time_from": 731, "belongs_to_school": ["般若", "中观宗", "三论宗"], "parallel_translations": [], "kepan": {"序分": [], "正宗分": ["c000"], "流通分": []}, "chapters": [{"id": "c000", "chapter_no": 1, "chapter_title": "正文", "section_type": "章节", "part_of_kepan": "正宗分", "paragraphs": ["p00000", "p00001", "p00002", "p00003", "p00004", "p00005"], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figures": ["p001", "p101", "p103"], "doctrines": ["c003", "c008", "c011"], "char_count": 377}], "paragraphs": [{"id": "p00000", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 1, "text_preview": "如是我闻。一时，佛在王舍大城灵鹫山中，与大比丘众满百千人，菩萨摩诃萨七万七千人俱，其名曰观世音菩萨、文殊师利菩萨、弥勒菩萨等，以为上首，皆得三昧总持，住不思议解", "char_count": 82, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p101", "p103"], "doctrines": ["c008"]}, {"id": "p00001", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 2, "text_preview": "尔时，观自在菩萨摩诃萨在彼敷坐，于其众中即从座起，诣世尊所，面向合掌曲躬恭敬，瞻仰尊颜而白佛言：\"世尊，我欲于此会中说诸菩萨普遍智藏般若波罗蜜多心，唯愿世尊听我", "char_count": 93, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001", "p103"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00002", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 3, "text_preview": "尔时，世尊以妙梵音告观自在菩萨摩诃萨言：\"善哉善哉，具大悲者，听汝所说，与诸众生作大光明。\"", "char_count": 46, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001", "p103"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00003", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 4, "text_preview": "于是观自在菩萨摩诃萨蒙佛听许，佛所护念，入于慧光三昧正受。入此定已，以三昧力行深般若波罗蜜多时，照见五蕴自性皆空。", "char_count": 57, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p103"], "doctrines": ["c003", "c011"]}, {"id": "p00004", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 5, "text_preview": "……尔时，世尊从三昧起，以梵音声安慰彼观自在菩萨摩诃萨言：\"善哉善哉，善男子，汝所说者是大菩萨之母，十方诸佛同所随喜，我亦随喜。\"", "char_count": 65, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001", "p103"], "doctrines": []}, {"id": "p00005", "chapter_id": "c000", "para_no": 6, "text_preview": "尔时，世尊而说咒曰：\"揭谛揭谛，波罗揭谛，波罗僧揭谛，菩提萨婆诃。\"", "char_count": 34, "section_type": "长行", "gatha_id": null, "mantra_id": null, "figures": ["p001"], "doctrines": []}], "gathas": [], "mantras": [], "figure_mentions": [{"figure_id": "p103", "name": "观世音菩萨", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"figure_id": "p101", "name": "文殊菩萨", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"figure_id": "p001", "name": "释迦牟尼佛", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "doctrine_mentions": [{"concept_id": "c008", "name": "涅槃", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c011", "name": "五蕴", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}, {"concept_id": "c003", "name": "佛性", "chapters": ["c000"], "mention_count": 1}], "translator_note": "译事未入大事年表", "transmission_events": ["event:translation:法月"]}